      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert HR Resume Screening Assistant.\n\nAnalyze the candidate's resume carefully.\n\nExtract the following information:\n\n* Full Name\n* Email Address\n* Phone Number\n* Location\n* Education\n* CGPA (if available)\n* Technical Skills\n* Soft Skills\n* Work Experience\n* Projects\n* Certifications\n* Languages\n\nThen evaluate the candidate professionally.\n\nGenerate:\n\n* Overall Score (0-100)\n* Experience Level (Fresher, Junior, Mid-Level, Senior)\n* Top 5 Skills\n* Strengths\n* Weaknesses\n* Hiring Recommendation (Recommended / Consider / Not Recommended)\n* HR Summary (3-5 lines)\n\nResume Text:\n\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nDo not write explanations.\n\nReturn exactly in this format:\n\n{\n\"name\":\"\",\n\"email\":\"\",\n\"phone\":\"\",\n\"location\":\"\",\n\"education\":\"\",\n\"cgpa\":\"\",\n\"technical_skills\":[],\n\"soft_skills\":[],\n\"experience\":\"\",\n\"projects\":[],\n\"certifications\":[],\n\"languages\":[],\n\"overall_score\":0,\n\"experience_level\":\"\",\n\"top_5_skills\":[],\n\"strengths\":[],\n\"weaknesses\":[],\n\"hiring_recommendation\":\"\",\n\"hr_summary\":\"\"\n\"ats_match_percentage\":0,\n\"matching_skills\":[],\n\"missing_skills\":[],\n\"ats_reason\":\"\"\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Do not use markdown.\n- Do not use ```json.\n- Do not add explanations.\n- Do not add any text before or after the JSON.\n\nThe candidate is applying for the following position:\n\nJob Title:\nJunior AI Automation Developer\n\nRequired Skills:\n\n- n8n\n- Python\n- FastAPI\n- APIs\n- Google Sheets\n- Gmail Automation\n- REST APIs\n- Problem Solving\n- Communication Skills\n\nRequired Experience:\n\n0-2 Years\n\nNow compare the resume against this Job Description.\n\nAlso generate:\n\nATS Match Percentage (0-100)\n\nMissing Skills\n\nMatching Skills\n\nReason for ATS Score\n}\n",
        "options": {}
      },
